1290 BM$="David: *groan* Wh-What happened...?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1300 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Sorry... You were sleeping soundly so I considered not waking you\up, but I thought you might have a nightmare if I left you alone.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1310 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Huh, is it night already...? Yeah, I was just sleeping, no dreams at all. I\wonder why King Hroth didn't show himself. Considering the situation, I\thought he'd tell me what to do.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1320 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Maybe he's at a loss, just like we are. Come on, let's go downstairs\and wait for Mr. Lands.":GOSUB 5100
1330 GOSUB 6100:BM$="Susanna took a lit candle and walked down the stairs to the dining room\with David. Then she made some coffee to stave off sleep.":GOSUB 5100
1340 BM$="According to David's watch, it was 11pm, but Lands was nowhere to be seen.\The castle had no telephone, so they could only wait.":GOSUB 5100
1350 COMMON FO:GOSUB 9515:BM$="Around midnight, they heard the sound of a car engine, and they saw the\gate opening. The car's headlights shone through the window.":GOSUB 5100
1360 GOSUB 9020:GOSUB 9525:BM$="Lands came running, leaving the car outside. Susanna hurried to open the\door.":GOSUB 5100:'
